# Xcode-generated products and archives
DerivedData/
build/
target/
*.xcarchive
*.xcarchive/
*.dSYM
*.dSYM.zip

# Local Portal Manager state and credential exports
**/Registries/
**/Registry/*.json
**/Registry/*.plist
**/Registry/*.db
**/*Registry*.json
**/*registry*.json
**/*keychain*
!PortalManager/Infrastructure/Credentials/KeychainCredentialStore.swift
**/*.keychain
**/*.keychain-db
**/*credentials*.json
**/*tokens*.json

# Local ADB/platform-tools and provisioning artifacts
**/adb
**/adb.exe
**/fastboot
**/fastboot.exe
**/platform-tools/
**/provisioning-artifacts/
**/provisioning-artifact*/
**/provisioning-output/
**/*.apk
**/*.aab

# Fixture secrets must never enter source control or app resources
PortalManagerTests/Fixtures/**/secrets/
PortalManagerTests/Fixtures/**/*secret*
PortalManagerTests/Fixtures/**/*credential*
PortalManagerTests/Fixtures/**/*token*
PortalManagerTests/Fixtures/**/*.env
